5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We need to ensure any new service is sustainable. I am concerned about relying on factors beyond our control. I suggest we examine the county grant terms and the endowment, and the winter road closures north of the river.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I agree! We should make sure everyone can actually get to the services. I'd like to look into the bus links in the two outer wards and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"It is wise to be cautious. I want to ensure we don't face a funding shortfall in a few years. I will look into the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"It's all very exciting, but let's not just guess what works. We often forget what we've already tried. I'll look into the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think we should be careful about the workload. I'll look into the volunteer register and supervision training, and the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. I just want to make sure we have the right people.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"It seems we have a good spread of data. @Daisuke, your focus on staffing is prudent, but we must also consider if external logistics will undermine those efforts. I will stick with my initial choices.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, you're so right! Logistics are key. I just want to make sure we aren't leaving anyone behind just because of where they live. I'm really excited to see those bus link details!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"I agree that logistics are important, but we must not overlook the financial structure. If the funding is unstable, the best logistics in the world won't save the project. I will proceed with my selections.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@George, money is important, but it's a waste of funds if we just repeat a failure from five years ago. Let's see if the history books have any warnings for us before we get too carried away.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with everyone. I just worry that if we don't have the right skills or too many tasks, the staff might struggle. I'll stick with my choices to check the certifications.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I believe we have covered the primary risks. By analyzing funding, historical data, and physical access, we can avoid the instability of the past. I am satisfied with our current distribution of research.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm happy too! It feels like we're all looking out for each other and the community. I can't wait to see if we can find a way to reach more people!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"I believe we have a comprehensive plan. By examining both the current financial lines and the grant terms, we can ensure this expansion is built on a stable foundation rather than a temporary surge.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'm glad we're on the same page. Let's just make sure we actually use the data we find instead of just nodding along to the loudest voice in the room. I'm ready to dig in.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope the information I find will be useful. I just don't want anyone to be overwhelmed. I'm ready to look into the registers and certifications now.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Since we are all in agreement, let us proceed. I will focus on the grant terms and the winter road closures to identify any external vulnerabilities that could disrupt our operations.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
