22,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'm all set too! I'll be checking those bus links and outreach sheets to make sure we're being fair to everyone, no matter where they live. Let's do our best for the community!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
