24,1,4,talk,George,,I am satisfied with the plan. I will focus on the endowment terms and the equipment lines to ensure we have a sustainable financial path forward. I look forward to seeing your findings.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
