76,3,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm voting for Option A too! It's the best way to make sure everyone feels included and supported, especially those who can't get to the main library. I'm so glad we found this!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
